& =\tan ^{-1}\left(\frac{2 \times \frac{3}{4}}{1-\left(\frac{3}{4}\right)^{2}}\right) \\
& =\tan ^{-1}\left(\frac{24}{7}\right) \\
& =\text { RHS }
\end{aligned}
$$

